plugin-system.coredump-summary = Whether crash dumps are kept on disk.
coredump-stored-title = Crash dumps are stored on disk
coredump-stored-summary = A crashing program leaves a copy of its memory behind (storage: { $storage }). It can contain passwords and keys.
coredump-may-affect-debugging = Crash reports and post-mortem debugging (coredumpctl) will have nothing to work with.
